program Finite ambiguity has witnesses.
# Intentional failure, zero model calls:
# tools/symblic run examples/12-finite-ambiguity.sym --by kernel --max-calls 0 --json
# Both 2 and 3 satisfy the predicate. The report must not claim a unique answer.
ask answer: Int in 1..3 "Return an integer greater than one." by kernel with solve=true
ensure answer > 1 else retry.
return answer.
